// ReleaseEntry Editorial notes are shown only in the requested locale: source text for the source locale, otherwise manual/machine text matching the current source hash. Unavailable editorial translations fall back to original upstream notes for the same version using source priority; without upstream notes, hasNotes is false and translation reports pending/failed/skipped. Editorial notes that only say the changes are not known count as unavailable in every locale: they fall back the same way, and without upstream notes the entry keeps its id, source, dates and sourceUrl with hasNotes false, no title, summary, body or sections, and translation none. The selected note supplies id/source/sourceLocale. Version and build grouping are preserved.
